Package: jarvis-backup-model
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-ollama
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: Built-in backup model for the Jarvis assistant on @DISTRO_NAME@
 A small local model (tool calling verified, English and Arabic) that
 Jarvis switches to when every configured provider fails. It answers with
 a restricted set of simple tools. Installed into the Ollama model store
 in /var/lib/ollama, byte for byte as pinned at build time.
